            "description": "be-brief\n===================\n\nA Wagtail app for short form posts. Please bear with us while we prepare more detailed documentation.\n\nCompatibility\n-------------\n\n`be-brief`' major.minor version number indicates the Wagtail release it is compatible with. Currently this is Wagtail 4.1.x\n\nInstallation\n------------\n\n1. Install using `pip`:\n  ```shell\n  pip install be-brief\n  ```\n2. Add\n   `be_brief` to your `INSTALLED_APPS` setting:\n   ```python\n   INSTALLED_APPS = [\n     # ...\n     'be_brief'\n     # ...\n   ]\n   ```\n\n\n",
